infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Attack economics: defend alone vs share a CDN
  desc Same $50–500/mo botnet — the cost asymmetry only inverts when defense is shared
  compares
    - label Defend alone
      children
        - label Botnet costs $50–500/mo
          desc Buys 10 Gbps sustained; scaling to 100 Gbps stays cheap for the attacker
        - label Origin pays per Gbps
          desc ~$500/mo bandwidth for 10 Gbps — and you cannot match 100 Gbps
        - label Economics favor the attacker
          desc You out-spend yourself before you out-scale the botnet
    - label Share a CDN
      children
        - label Same $50–500/mo botnet
          desc The attacker's cost is unchanged — only the defender's changes
        - label Edge absorbs 100s of Tbps
          desc 330+ PoPs ingest the flood; a 10 Gbps hit is a rounding error
        - label Cost amortized across millions
          desc Per-customer defense cost is tiny — the attack just fails
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
